WEBVTT - Ramesh Kumar Patient Testimonial (English)

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.500
Namaste, I am Ramesh Kumar from Dobhi village in Gaya district, Bihar.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.000
For over a year, my cataract was worsening, and local private clinics quoted over ₹28,000.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:17.000
Our village Gram Mitra Manoj registered me on the Aapka platform and guided my Ayushman Bharat claim.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:24.000
Aapka escorted me directly to their partner hospital, managed all the paperwork, and my surgery was completed with zero out-of-pocket stress.

00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:28.000
I got my vision back, and my family saved over ₹18,500. Thank you Aapka!
